    },
    "Each app and app extension installed with SideStore must register an App ID with Apple.\n\nApp IDs for paid developer accounts never expire, and there is no limit to how many you can create." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each app and app extension installed with SideStore must register an App ID with Apple.\n\nApp IDs for paid developer accounts never expire, and there is no limit to how many you can create."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SideStore로 설치된 각 앱 및 앱 확장 프로그램은 Apple에 앱 ID를 등록해야 합니다.\n\n유료 개발자 계정의 앱 ID는 만료되지 않으며, 생성할 수 있는 개수에 제한이 없습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each app and app extension installed with SideStore must register an App ID with Apple. Apple limits non-developer Apple IDs to 10 App IDs at a time.\n\n**App IDs can't be deleted**, but they do expire after one week. SideStore will automatically renew App IDs for all active apps once they've expired." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each app and app extension installed with SideStore must register an App ID with Apple. Apple limits non-developer Apple IDs to 10 App IDs at a time.\n\n**App IDs can't be deleted**, but they do expire after one week. SideStore will automatically renew App IDs for all active apps once they've expired."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SideStore로 설치된 각 앱 및 앱 확장 프로그램은 Apple에 앱 ID를 등록해야 합니다. Apple은 비개발자 Apple 계정의 경우 한 번에 최대 10개의 앱 ID로 제한합니다.\n\n**앱 ID는 삭제할 수 없지만**, 1주일 후 만료됩니다. SideStore는 만료된 활성 앱의 앱 ID를 자동으로 새로고침합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
