    "If deleted, SideStore will require the original IPA file during reinstall, backup, resign, or refresh procedures. Are you sure you want to delete the cached app bundle for “%@” ?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If deleted, SideStore will require the original IPA file during reinstall, backup, resign, or refresh procedures. Are you sure you want to delete the cached app bundle for “%@” ?"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "삭제하면 재설치, 백업, 재서명 또는 새로고침 과정에서 SideStore가 원본 IPA 파일을 필요로 하게 됩니다. “%@”의 캐시된 앱 번들을 삭제하시겠습니까?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the bundle ID is not present in the database, it will install as a separate app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If the bundle ID is not present in the database, it will install as a separate app."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "번들 ID가 데이터베이스에 없으면 별도의 앱으로 설치됩니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you're using the MacDirtyCow exploit to remove the 3-app limit, you can install up to 10 apps and app extensions instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
