    "Non-developer Apple IDs are limited to 3 apps and app extensions. Inactive apps don't count towards your total, but cannot be opened until activated." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Non-developer Apple IDs are limited to 3 apps and app extensions. Inactive apps don't count towards your total, but cannot be opened until activated."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "비개발자 Apple 계정은 앱 및 앱 확장 프로그램을 최대 3개까지 사용할 수 있습니다. 비활성 앱은 총 개수에 포함되지 않지만, 활성화하기 전까지는 열 수 없습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Non-developer Apple IDs are limited to 3 apps. Inactive apps are backed up and uninstalled so they don't count towards your total, but will be reinstalled with all their data when activated again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Non-developer Apple IDs are limited to 3 apps. Inactive apps are backed up and uninstalled so they don't count towards your total, but will be reinstalled with all their data when activated again."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "비개발자 Apple 계정은 앱을 최대 3개까지 사용할 수 있습니다. 비활성 앱은 백업 후 삭제되어 총 개수에 포함되지 않으며, 다시 활성화하면 모든 데이터와 함께 재설치됩니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
