    "Switching to App Bundle prioritizes storage efficiency by transferring the app bundle directly without packaging a temporary IPA, but transfer speeds will be noticeably slower." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Switching to App Bundle prioritizes storage efficiency by transferring the app bundle directly without packaging a temporary IPA, but transfer speeds will be noticeably slower."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "앱 번들로 전환하면 임시 IPA를 패키징하지 않고 앱 번들을 직접 전송하여 저장 공간 효율을 우선시하지만, 전송 속도는 눈에 띄게 느려집니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switching to Resigned IPA prioritizes install speed (~40% faster) by packaging an uncompressed IPA for fast transfer, but temporarily uses additional disk space during packaging." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Switching to Resigned IPA prioritizes install speed (~40% faster) by packaging an uncompressed IPA for fast transfer, but temporarily uses additional disk space during packaging."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "재서명된 IPA로 전환하면 빠른 전송을 위해 압축되지 않은 IPA를 패키징하여 설치 속도(약 40% 빠름)를 우선시하지만, 패키징 중 일시적으로 추가 디스크 공간을 사용합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
